# Nothing in this repository needs a secret.
#
# The contract tooling (lint, guards, mock server) runs without any environment variable:
#   npx @redocly/cli@1.34.5 lint --config packages/openapi/redocly.yaml packages/openapi/openapi.yaml
#   npx @stoplight/prism-cli@5 mock packages/openapi/openapi.yaml --port 4010
#
# The app's own configuration is described in mobile/README.md. Signing keys and store
# credentials are never kept in this repository.
